# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BabySitter App — Environment Variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` (same directory) and fill in real values.
# There is NO .env committed; the app runs without it (API uses the Vite proxy).

# No map API key is required — the interactive maps use Leaflet with free
# OpenStreetMap tiles. (Nominatim geocoding is also free, used sparingly.)

# Optional: absolute backend base URL. When omitted, requests go to the Vite
# dev proxy (/api -> https://localhost:44368) configured in vite.config.js.
# VITE_API_BASE=